      "message": "\u003e LLVM ERROR: Invalid size request on a scalable vector.\n\nLooks like an error in LLVM backend when sve/sve2 (implied by armv9-a) is enabled.  We should report it to upstream (Can you get a repro by adding `-Wl,--reproduce\u003drepro.tar` and file an internal bug? I can follow up upstream)\n\nDigging deeper, based on https://reviews.llvm.org/D98856#2647927, it looks like this error is disabled by default for compiler actions but doesn\u0027t work with LTO.  Does adding `-Wl,-mllvm,-treat-scalable-fixed-error-as-warning` to the linker help?",
